-generation variable fighter. Competing to win the funding are Shinsei Industries' YF-19 and General Galaxy's YF-21. Piloting the YF-21 is Guld Goa Bowman, a half-human, half-Zentraedi. Shinsei receives its new test pilot in the form of the unruly fighter pilot Isamu Dyson, who was once a friend of Guld. Meanwhile, as Isamu and Guld furiously battle to see which of their fighters is superior, a Virturoid Idol named Sharon Apple is to perform her debut concert on Eden. In charge of Sharon is producer Myung Fang Lone, another former friend of Isamu and Guld. When the three meet each other, old disputes spark from a troubled past. Little do they know that their past incidents - along with the Supernova Project and Sharon Apple - will somehow bring them together.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Idol","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Artificial Intelligence","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aviation","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Military","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Space","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":46,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":36,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Macross Plus Movie Edition","english":"Macross Plus Movie Edition","native":"マクロスプラス　ＭＯＶＩＥ　ＥＤＩＴＩＯＮ","romaji":"Macross Plus MOVIE EDITION","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"超时空要塞Plus 剧场版"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"劇場版 マクロスプラス"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}